---
name: hero
type: registry:block
title: Hero
description: A full-bleed marketing hero with announcement badge, dual CTAs, and an optional product image.
files:
  - path: registry/items/blocks/hero/hero.svelte
    type: registry:block
    target: components/blocks/hero.svelte
---

A full-width hero section for landing pages: an optional announcement badge, a headline, description, one or two calls to action, and an optional product screenshot.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import Hero from "$lib/components/blocks/hero.svelte";
</script>

<Hero
  announcement="New: v2.0 is here"
  title="Build your design system faster"
  description="A shadcn-svelte based component registry, ready to install into any project."
  primaryCta={{ label: "Get Started", href: "/docs/installation" }}
  secondaryCta={{ label: "Browse components", href: "/components" }}
/>
```
